<title>USA: Delta expands code sharing with Aeromexico.</title>
<headline>Delta expands code sharing with Aeromexico.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said Monday it has expended its code-sharing agreement with Aerovias de Mexico (Aeromexico), increasing its routes and adding new service to cities in Mexico effective April 6.</p>
<p>The expanded agreement takes effect pending government approvals, Delta said.</p>
</text>
